@startuml opencode-coordinator-fsm
!theme plain
title SessionRunCoordinator 状态机 (run-coordinator.ts)

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Draining : run() / wake()

Draining --> Draining : coalesced wake\n(合并为 pending rerun)
Draining --> DrainingPending : run() 升级 pending
DrainingPending --> Draining : 当前 chain 结束\n执行 coalesced rerun

Draining --> Idle : drain 完成
DrainingPending --> Idle : drain 完成

Draining --> Interrupted : interrupt(seq)
DrainingPending --> Interrupted : interrupt(seq)
Interrupted --> Idle : cleanup 完成\nsuppress 旧 wake

note right of Draining
  每 Session ID 最多
  一条 active drain chain
  不同 Session 可并发
end note

note right of Idle
  run = 显式 drain
  wake = advisory\nresume:false 仅 admit 不 wake
end note

@enduml
